<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112083" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορβ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pasture, food,</i> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only of horses and asses, <i>fodder, forage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.202
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11.562
			</span></i>; of men, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρποὺς ἐς φ. κατατίθεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.202
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				4.121
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληρωθέντες φορβῆς καὶ οἴνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.211
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				43
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				162
			</span></i> (anap.); of birds of prey, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρνισι φ. παραλίοις γενήσεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1065
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				348
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			metaph., <i>fuel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				5.238
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Paul.Sil.
			</span></i>).</div>
